---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About SetupKaro" desc="Practical tools and guides to help creators, freelancers and first-time builders in India.">
<main class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
<div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border mt-4 p-6 sm:p-8">
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500">About › About</div>
<h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mt-1">About SetupKaro</h1>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Practical tools and guides to help creators, freelancers and first-time builders in India.</p>

<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4 mt-4 flex gap-3 items-start max-w-xl">
<span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 font-extrabold text-xl w-11 h-11 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full shrink-0">N</span>
<div class="text-sm"><b>Built by Noyel G</b><div class="text-gray-600">Engineer • Creator • Learner<br/>I build simple tools and write practical guides based on real experience. No fluff. Just what works.</div></div>
</div>

<div class="font-bold mt-6 mb-2">Why SetupKaro?</div>
<div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 max-w-2xl">
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4 text-sm"><div class="text-xl">⚡</div><b>Simple & practical</b><div class="text-gray-600 text-xs mt-1">No jargon, no hype.</div></div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4 text-sm"><div class="text-xl">❤️</div><b>Made for India</b><div class="text-gray-600 text-xs mt-1">Prices in INR, real recommendations.</div></div>
<div class="border rounded-2xl p-4 text-sm"><div class="text-xl">👥</div><b>For creators & freelancers</b><div class="text-gray-600 text-xs mt-1">Tools to help you start, grow and earn.</div></div>
</div>

<blockquote class="mt-6 text-gray-600">❝ <i>Better tools. More people building things they love.</i> ❞<div class="text-sm mt-1">— Noyel G</div></blockquote>
</div>
</main>
</Layout>
